# Coding Standards

- Path alias `@/` → `src/`
- Shared types in `src/lib/types.ts`; static data in `src/data/`
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- PascalCase component files; `use*` hooks; kebab-case routes
- No `any`; reuse `CategoryId` and existing interfaces
- Website CMS APIs: use `src/lib/api/` (SSR fetch + mappers). See `.cursor/skills/api-integration/SKILL.md`
- Forms: validate per PRD; do not invent unverified backends

See `docs/knowledge/CODING_STANDARDS.md` and `NAMING_CONVENTIONS.md`.
